  "description": "When Seonwoo Baek was asked in high school why he liked Yujeong Ki, his answer was, “I just noticed one day that I always found myself looking for him. From the moment I first saw him, I haven’t been able to take my eyes off of him. It’s like he’s got the whole world on his shoulders or something. He looks like he might disappear at any moment, which makes me anxious, so I can’t take my eyes off him.” But after reuniting as adults, he’s still asking himself, “Am I gay or... do I just like YOU?” \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 4 side stories.*",
